l-label" aria-hidden="true">DBUs per hour</span>628.00</td><td><span class="pricing-cell-label" aria-hidden="true">Hourly cost</span>$43.96/hour</td></tr><tr role="row"><td>H100 x 1 GPU or equivalent</td><td><span class="pricing-cell-label" aria-hidden="true">DBUs per hour</span>100.00</td><td><span class="pricing-cell-label" aria-hidden="true">Hourly cost</span>$7.00/hour</td></tr><tr role="row"><td>H100 x 8 GPU or equivalent</td><td><span class="pricing-cell-label" aria-hidden="true">DBUs per hour</span>800.00</td><td><span class="pricing-cell-label" aria-hidden="true">Hourly cost</span>$56.00/hour</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="table-note">Published rates checked October 6, 2026. Pay-per-token, CPU and provisioned throughput endpoints use different pricing.</p><p class="pricing-region-note">Prices shown for <span class="pricing-region">US East (AWS us-east-1)</span><a href="https://www.databricks.com/product/pricing/model-serving" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View official Databricks pricing</a>.</p></section>
